Scoped copy video filter

The copy descriptor in src/video-ops/copy.ts follows libavfilter/vf_copy.c
(query_formats, filter_frame and the ff_vf_copy registration): every
non-hwaccel format is accepted and frames reach the output unchanged.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
vf_copy.c carries no individual copyright line; it is part of FFmpeg,
