See ../../LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-or-later.txt.
The original source and full notices remain in the pinned upstream submodule.
This is a scoped TypeScript adaptation,not the complete copy filter: it refuses
every option, including enable= and the generic threads option, and runtime commands.
